g with ratios"}]}]}}, "index": "aCWa2", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 4620, "y": 4632.9999999999945, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-7q", "type": "frame", "props": {"w": 1400, "h": 2267.600000000006, "name": "8.12 DuPont analysis", "color": "black"}, "parentId": "page:page", "index": "a9KKQ", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 712, "y": 622.9599999999919, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-93", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch08-8t", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "7.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Inventory: lower of cost or market value. Receivables: net of doubtful debt provision."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aAnkX", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 2148.600000000006, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-8r", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-88", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Owners know the business best, and trade within SEBI's guidelines. Their trades can give insight. Peter Lynch, quoted in the book: insiders sell for many reasons, which need not ring alarm bells, \"but if insiders are buying, then there can be only one reason that the company is likely to make huge profits in future\"."}]}]}}, "index": "aJCEA", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 222, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-9s", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch08-9o", "props": {"color": "light-violet", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "1.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Pick a listed company. Do its standalone and consolidated revenues differ much? Why?"}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "a41wf", "typeName": "shape"}, {"meta": {}, "id": "binding:Hi52jZc9iKLwVAQryaKE5", "type": "arrow", "fromId": "shape:ch08-3y", "toId": "shape:ch08-3t", "props": {"isPrecise": false, "isExact": false, "normalizedAnchor": {"x": 0.5, "y": 0.5}, "snap": "none", "terminal": "start"}, "typeName": "binding"}, {"x": 712, "y": 459, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-h", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-9", "props": {"w": 632, "h": 174, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "violet", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "2", "marks": [{"type": "italic"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Statement of profit and loss", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Income, expenses and profit "}, {"type": "text", "text": "for the period", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". Must include "}, {"type": "text", "text": "other comprehensive income (OCI)", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}}, "index": "a8X0A", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 239.56794425087108, "y": 1427, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-1l", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-t", "props": {"w": 413.10104529616723, "h": 126, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Strategic stakes the company does not control"}]}]}}, "index": "aSndz", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 216, "y": 60, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-2m", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-2k", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "xl", "w": 940, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1.2, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The profit and loss account"}]}]}}, "index": "a2rBE", "typeName": "shape"}, {"meta": {}, "id": "binding:QFbPC5kzjx_2h_vckNgz6", "type": "arrow", "fromId": "shape:ch08-3w", "toId": "shape:ch08-3r", "props": {"isPrecise": false, "isExact": false, "normalizedAnchor": {"x": 0.5, "y": 0.5}, "snap": "none", "terminal": "start"}, "typeName": "binding"}, {"x": 56, "y": 2265, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-3n", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-2k", "props": {"color": "violet", "size": "l", "w": 1288, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "8.4.2 Profit metrics"}]}]}}, "index": "adJCM", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 2041, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-50", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-43", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1004, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Expansion (negative investing cash flow) is funded by operating cash, past cash balances, or financing. Be cautious with firms that rely heavily on borrowing to expand: assets may realise less than book value, but liabilities must be paid in full."}]}]}}, "index": "aXIW2", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 303.5151515151515, "y": 1769, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-4o", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-43", "props": {"w": 201.69696969696975, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "−4,301.12"}]}]}}, "index": "aL2D2", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1171, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-61", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-5n", "props": {"w": 279.5604395604396, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "violet", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Ratio", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "aEe4z", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 216, "y": 60, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-5p", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-5n", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "xl", "w": 940, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1.2, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Why ratios?"}]}]}}, "index": "a2Ykr", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 343.5604395604396, "y": 2299, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-72", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-5n", "props": {"w": 283.0549450549451, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Current assets ÷ Current liabilities"}]}]}}, "index": "ap8Sf", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 343.5604395604396, "y": 1931, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-6q", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-5n", "props": {"w": 283.0549450549451, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph"}]}}, "index": "adYIb", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1213.800000000003, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-83", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-7q", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1004, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Analysts use how items behaved in the past to forecast. But that assumes the past represents the future, which need not hold. Apply judgement and adjust for changes."}]}]}}, "index": "aDzKc", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 56, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-7r", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-7q", "props": {"w": 128, "h": 128, "geo": "ellipse", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "violet", "labelColor": "white", "fill": "fill", "size": "l", "font": "sans", "align": "middle", "verticalAlign": "middle", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "8.12", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "a1YDA", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1040, "y": 622.9599999999919, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-94", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch08-8t", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "8.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Investments in JVs and associates use the equity method."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aBovn", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 2270.600000000006, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-8s", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-88", "props": {"color": "grey", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The book's text gives Bharti Airtel's total debt as \"Rs.12.87 billion\" and core working capital as \"negative Rs.2.36 billion\", but its own tables (in Rs million) show 12,87,036 and minus 2,36,141. The quiz does not use these two figures."}]}]}}, "index": "aK7rf", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 384, "y": 222, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-9t", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch08-9o", "props": {"color": "light-violet", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "2.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Why might a profitable company still run out of cash? Use the book's Rs 80,000 example."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "a5aEU", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 657, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-i", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-9", "props": {"w": 632, "h": 174, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "3", "marks": [{"type": "italic"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Statement of changes in equity", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "How shareholders' funds changed: profit, dividends, new shares, buybacks, OCI."}]}]}}, "index": "a9Ghv", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 660.6689895470383, "y": 1427, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-1m", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-t", "props": {"w": 399.3310104529616, "h": 126, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Equity method", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": adjusted for its share of profit and OCI, reduced by dividends received"}]}]}}, "index": "aTwk2", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 216, "y": 138.8000000000029, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-2n", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-2k", "props": {"color": "grey", "size": "m", "w": 1128, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Chapter 8 of 15"}]}]}}, "index": "a3sav", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 2897, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-40", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-2k", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Gross profit", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " suits manufacturers, but Indian companies disclose only raw material costs among direct costs, so it usually "}, {"type": "text", "text": "cannot be calculated", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "EBITDA", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " is not affected by "}, {"type": "text", "text": "capital structure", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (interest) or "}, {"type": "text", "text": "infrastructure and accounting choices", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (depreciation), so it is the right metric to "}, {"type": "text", "text": "compare firms", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", even across sectors. \"Adjusted EBITDA\" also strips out investment and other non-operating income. EBITDA is a proxy for cash profit, but use it that way only as a last resort."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "EBIT", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " is called "}, {"type": "text", "text": "operating profit", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". It shows the ability to meet interest, and feeds the interest coverage ratio and free cash flow to the firm."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "PAT", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (net profit, EAT) is what is left for shareholders after interest and tax."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Adjusted PAT", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " removes exceptional items, "}, {"type": "text", "text": "with their tax impact", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", so years can be compared. It may need judgement: Bharti Airtel's FY 2019 effective tax rate was \"not meaningful\" because it paid huge taxes despite reporting losses."}]}]}]}]}}, "index": "angeI", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 2340, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-3o", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-2k", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Most companies present a "}, {"type": "text", "text": "single-step", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " P&L (all income minus all expenses = profit before tax). Some, like Bharti Airtel, present a "}, {"type": "text", "text": "multi-step", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " P&L showing EBITDA. Analysts often redraw single-step statements into multi-step ones."}]}]}}, "index": "aeoUR", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1084, "y": 2041, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-51", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch08-43", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "EXAM TRAP", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Four rules from the book: "}, {"type": "text", "text": "net cash flow can deceive", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "; analyse operating, investing and financing "}, {"type": "text", "text": "separately", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "; focus on "}, {"type": "text", "text": "sustainable, recurring", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " cash flows; adjust for "}, {"type": "text", "text": "non-recurring", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " items."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 168, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.3, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aYra2", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 513.2121212121212, "y": 1769, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-4p", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-43", "props": {"w": 201.69696969696975, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "−3,446.09"}]}]}}, "index": "aMbPA", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 343.5604395604396, "y": 1171, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-62", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-5n", "props": {"w": 283.0549450549451, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "violet", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Formula", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "aFWZv", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 216, "y": 138.8000000000029, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-5q", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-5n", "props": {"color": "grey", "size": "m", "w": 1128, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Chapter 8 of 15"}]}]}}, "index": "a3AcQ", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 634.6153846153848, "y": 2299, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-73", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-5n", "props": {"w": 709.3846153846154, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Also called working capital ratio. Bharti: 0.35"}]}]}}, "index": "aqbsQ", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 634.6153846153848, "y": 1931, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-6r", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-5n", "props": {"w": 709.3846153846154, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph"}]}}, "index": "aeZvQ", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1084, "y": 1213.800000000003, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-84", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch08-7q", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "EXAM TRAP", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The book's example: "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Suzlon", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " was the only wind turbine maker, with great pricing power, until it faced tremendous domestic and offshore competition starting from the middle of 2000 (as the book puts it). Projecting its financials purely from history would have been a blunder."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 336, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.3, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aEEuE", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 216, "y": 60, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-7s", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-7q", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "xl", "w": 940, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1.2, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "DuPont analysis"}]}]}}, "index": "a2qpM", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 950.9599999999919, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-95", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch08-8t", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "9.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Minority interest appears only in consolidated statements."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aCxRr", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 6160, "y": 3351.2000000000057, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-8t", "type": "frame", "props": {"w": 1400, "h": 2622.959999999992, "name": "All exam traps in this chapter", "color": "black"}, "parentId": "page:page", "index": "aBOUi", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 712, "y": 222, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-9u", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch08-9o", "props": {"color": "light-violet", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "3.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Bharti Airtel's current ratio was 0.35. Is that a problem? Argue both sides."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "a6yF6", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 712, "y": 657, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-j", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-9", "props": {"w": 632, "h": 174, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "4", "marks": [{"type": "italic"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cash flow statement", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Sources and uses of cash."}]}]}}, "index": "aAHKU", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1561, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-1n", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-t", "props": {"w": 175.56794425087108, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Non-current financial assets", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "aUBhQ", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 855, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-30", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-2k", "props": {"w": 272.12598425196853, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Change in inventory of WIP and finished goods", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "aGxbv", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 222, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-2o", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-2k", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Shows performance "}, {"type": "text", "text": "for a period", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". Format: Schedule III; Ind AS 1 adds "}, {"type": "text", "text": "OCI", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", shown below net profit. Banks, insurers and utilities use their regulators' formats."}]}]}}, "index": "a4zvw", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 3289, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-41", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-2k", "props": {"color": "violet", "size": "l", "w": 1288, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "8.5 Statement of changes in equity"}]}]}}, "index": "aomDU", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 2444, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-3p", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-2k", "props": {"color": "violet", "size": "l", "w": 1288, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "From revenue to profit"}]}]}}, "index": "afKv6", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 3080, "y": 3503.999999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-52", "type": "frame", "props": {"w": 1400, "h": 2251.199999999997, "name": "8.7 Notes to accounts", "color": "black"}, "parentId": "page:page", "index": "a7ob2", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 722.909090909091, "y": 1769, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-4q", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-43", "props": {"w": 201.69696969696975, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "−1,520.78"}]}]}}, "index": "aNPuU", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 634.6153846153848, "y": 1171, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-63", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-5n", "props": {"w": 709.3846153846154, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "violet", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Reading it", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "aGJFE", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 222, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-5r", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-5n", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A number alone means little. Bharti Airtel's FY 2019 EBIT of Rs 47.62 billion sounds large, until you compare it with revenue of Rs 807.8 billion (only 5.8%), or with interest expense of over Rs 110 billion (not enough to pay it). "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Ratio analysis", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " expresses one line item as a percentage or multiple of a related one. Only compare numbers that are related."}]}]}}, "index": "a4SJQ", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 2409, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-74", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-5n", "props": {"w": 279.5604395604396, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Quick ratio", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "arsQf", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 2017, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-6s", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-5n", "props": {"w": 279.5604395604396, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Debt / Equity", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "afwhI", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1936.6000000000058, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-85", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-7q", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Quotes from the book: Warren Buffett has \"no use whatsoever for projections or forecasts\" and looks deeply at "}, {"type": "text", "text": "track records", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". Charlie Munger says projections \"do more harm than good\". Graham and Dodd: a past trend is a fact, a future trend only an assumption, and the past is only a \"rough index\" to the future."}]}]}}, "index": "aF3Sj", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 216, "y": 138.8000000000029, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-7t", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-7q", "props": {"color": "grey", "size": "m", "w": 1128, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Chapter 8 of 15"}]}]}}, "index": "a3fpU", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 384, "y": 950.9599999999919, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-96", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch08-8t", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "10.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Provision: specific obligation. Reserve: no specific obligation."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "