f tangible assets over their useful life. Ind AS 16: method should reflect how the asset is used (a cab fleet by distance)"}]}]}}, "index": "aLuzg", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 336.12598425196853, "y": 487, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-2t", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-2k", "props": {"w": 1007.8740157480315, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Sales of goods and services from core and incidental operations. Some show incidental income as \"other operating income\""}]}]}}, "index": "a9dqU", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 216, "y": 138.8000000000029, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-46", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-43", "props": {"color": "grey", "size": "m", "w": 1128, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Chapter 8 of 15"}]}]}}, "index": "a3d2Q", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 894.8000000000001, "y": 2577, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-3u", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-2k", "props": {"w": 169.6, "h": 294, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "violet", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "EBIT", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "\"Operating profit\""}]}]}}, "index": "akQe2", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 311, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-57", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-52", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "There are several ways to account for an item, for example "}, {"type": "text", "text": "straight-line", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " or "}, {"type": "text", "text": "written-down value", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " depreciation. The policies show which way the company chose. Companies must state any change from last year. "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Frequent changes", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " in policy are a reason for suspicion of manipulation."}]}]}}, "index": "a5UMs", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 513.2121212121212, "y": 1855, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-4v", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-43", "props": {"w": 201.69696969696975, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "−885.55"}]}]}}, "index": "aSYwE", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 343.5604395604396, "y": 1343, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-68", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-5n", "props": {"w": 283.0549450549451, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "EBITDA ÷ Net sales"}]}]}}, "index": "aLh1U", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 930.6666666666666, "y": 523, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-5w", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-5n", "props": {"w": 413.3333333333333, "h": 264, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Predictive", "marks": [{"type": "italic"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Shows how costs behave: most costs stayed a steady % of sales (they move with sales); network costs rose as sales fell, so they are largely "}, {"type": "text", "text": "fixed", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". Two years of data is too little; more data gives more confidence."}]}]}}, "index": "a9yob", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 634.6153846153848, "y": 2519, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-79", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-5n", "props": {"w": 709.3846153846154, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph"}]}}, "index": "awttr", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 634.6153846153848, "y": 2127, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-6x", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-5n", "props": {"w": 709.3846153846154, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Below 1 or negative: earnings do not cover interest"}]}]}}, "index": "akyJf", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 741.3333333333334, "y": 422, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-7y", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-7q", "props": {"w": 318.6666666666667, "h": 144, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "red", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "3", "marks": [{"type": "italic"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Equity multiplier", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Leverage"}]}]}}, "index": "a8l4I", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 712, "y": 222, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-8z", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch08-8t", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "3.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Control: more than 50% votes, or right to appoint the board majority, or de facto control (Ind AS 110)."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 24, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "a6wEA", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1352, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-p", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-9", "props": {"w": 1288, "h": 234, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Control", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": Owning more than 50% of voting rights, "}, {"type": "text", "text": "or", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " the right to appoint a majority of the board. Even without 50%, a company that can direct a subsidiary's strategy and operations to change its returns is in de facto control, and must consolidate under "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Ind AS 110", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Holding (parent)", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": The company that controls."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Subsidiary", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": The company that is controlled. Book examples: Jio Platforms (controlled by Reliance Industries); Toyota Kirloskar Motor (majority owned by Toyota Motor Corporation, Japan)."}]}]}]}]}}, "index": "aG1dI", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 239.56794425087108, "y": 719, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-13", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-t", "props": {"w": 413.10104529616723, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "violet", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "What it is", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "aAXeU", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 311, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-25", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-20", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Equity", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " = assets minus liabilities. Its parts:"}]}]}}, "index": "a50tI", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1781, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-1t", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-t", "props": {"w": 175.56794425087108, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Current financial assets", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "aaEGE", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1161, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-36", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-2k", "props": {"w": 272.12598425196853, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Amortisation", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "aMR8X", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 597, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-2u", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-2k", "props": {"w": 272.12598425196853, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Other income", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "aA9RU", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 222, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-47", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-43", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1004, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Accounts use the "}, {"type": "text", "text": "accrual", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " basis: income counts when earned, not when received; expenses when incurred, not when paid. So profit and cash can differ a lot."}]}]}}, "index": "a4aDQ", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1174.4, "y": 2577, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-3v", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-2k", "props": {"w": 169.6, "h": 294, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "green", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "PAT", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Net profit for shareholders"}]}]}}, "index": "alHPz", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 447, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-58", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-52", "props": {"color": "violet", "size": "l", "w": 1288, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "8.7.2 Contingent liabilities"}]}]}}, "index": "a6LUY", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 722.909090909091, "y": 1855, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-4w", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-43", "props": {"w": 201.69696969696975, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "−2.23"}]}]}}, "index": "aTvPr", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 634.6153846153848, "y": 1343, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-69", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-5n", "props": {"w": 709.3846153846154, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Operating efficiency; not affected by depreciation policy, funding or tax. Bharti: 32.2% (FY18: 36.6%)"}]}]}}, "index": "aMCjn", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 827, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-5x", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-5n", "props": {"color": "violet", "size": "l", "w": 1288, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "8.11 Commonly used ratios"}]}]}}, "index": "aAiDb", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 2213, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-6y", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-5n", "props": {"w": 279.5604395604396, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Liquidity", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "alimQ", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1084, "y": 422, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-7z", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch08-7q", "props": {"color": "light-blue", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Why split it?", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "ROE that rises from better margins or efficiency is good news. ROE that rises from more leverage need not be, because leverage also adds risk."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 96, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.3, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "a9ZBn", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1612, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-q", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-9", "props": {"w": 490, "h": 234, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "green", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Usually prefer consolidated", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "It gives a more holistic picture of the group."}]}]}}, "index": "aHZc2", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 660.6689895470383, "y": 719, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-14", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-t", "props": {"w": 399.3310104529616, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "violet", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "How it is shown", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "aBwEU", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 369, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-26", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-20", "props": {"w": 1288, "h": 264, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Share capital", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": Face value of paid-up shares."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Share premium", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": Amount received above face value when shares were issued (IPO or FPO)."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Retained earnings", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": Profit and OCI not paid out as dividend or set aside."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "General reserve", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": Retained earnings set aside for future use."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Capital and revaluation reserve", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": Surplus from showing assets above purchase price. Usually "}, {"type": "text", "text": "not available for dividends", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Non-controlling (minority) interest", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": Outside shareholders' share of a subsidiary's equity. Appears "}, {"type": "text", "text": "only in consolidated", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " statements."}]}]}]}]}}, "index": "a6Asj", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 239.56794425087108, "y": 1781, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-1u", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-t", "props": {"w": 413.10104529616723, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cash and cash equivalents, bank balances, receivables, short-term investments"}]}]}}, "index": "abwU9", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 336.12598425196853, "y": 1161, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-37", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-2k", "props": {"w": 1007.8740157480315, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Gradual write-off of intangible assets"}]}]}}, "index": "aNT7I", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 336.12598425196853, "y": 597, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-2v", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-2k", "props": {"w": 1007.8740157480315, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Non-operating income: investment income, profit on sale of assets"}]}]}}, "index": "aB3iM", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1084, "y": 222, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-48", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch08-43", "props": {"color": "light-green", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "ANALOGY", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The book's example: buy goods for Rs 80,000 in cash, sell them for Rs 1,00,000. If the sale is in cash, you have a Rs 20,000 profit and the cash. If the sale is on credit, the P&L still shows Rs 20,000 profit, but there is no money. If the customer never pays, even the Rs 80,000 is lost. Profit without cash is \"paper profit\"."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 360, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.3, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "a5tvE", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 140.8, "y": 2724, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-3w", "type": "arrow", "parentId": "shape:ch08-2k", "props": {"kind": "arc", "elbowMidPoint": 0.5, "dash": "draw", "size": "m", "fill": "none", "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "bend": 0, "start": {"x": 0, "y": 0}, "end": {"x": 279.6, "y": 0}, "arrowheadStart": "none", "arrowheadEnd": "arrow", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph"}]}, "labelPosition": 0.5, "font": "draw", "scale": 1}, "index": "aigKF", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 522, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-59", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-52", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1004, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Liabilities that arise only if an uncertain future event goes against the company. They are "}, {"type": "text", "text": "not recorded in the accounts", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", only in the notes. Examples: outstanding lawsuits, tax disputes, bank guarantees given, product warranty claims, pending investigations, changes in FX or government policy."}]}]}}, "index": "a7uI2", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 932.6060606060607, "y": 1855, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-4x", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-43", "props": {"w": 201.69696969696975, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "−1,665.09"}]}]}}, "index": "aURDI", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 902, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-5y", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-5n", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Very high profitability rarely lasts: new entrants and competition pull it back to moderate levels. Ratios that compare a period figure (sales, profit) with a balance sheet figure (equity, assets) should use the "}, {"type": "text", "text": "average", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " balance, usually the average of opening and closing."}]}]}}, "index": "aB9aQ", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 343.5604395604396, "y": 2213, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-6z", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-5n", "props": {"w": 283.0549450549451, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph"}]}}, "index": "amsqf", "typeName": "shape"}, {"meta": {}, "id": "binding:HdLFzJ5xUj4GyT3wHklkr", "type": "arrow", "fromId": "shape:ch08-3z", "toId": "shape:ch08-3v", "props": {"isPrecise": false, "isExact": false, "normalizedAnchor": {"x": 0.5, "y": 0.5}, "snap": "none", "terminal": "end"}, "typeName": "binding"}, {"x": 570, "y": 1612, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-r", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-9", "props": {"w": 490, "h": 234, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Also check standalone when...", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Subsidiaries cannot pass dividends to the parent: strict capital controls in their country, or a debt covenant banning dividends. Then ask: can the parent stand on its own in a crisis?"}]}]}}, "index": "aIcoj", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 805, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-15", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-t", "props": {"w": 175.56794425087108, "h": 126, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Property, plant and equipment (PPE)", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "aCI8X", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 673, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-27", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-20", "props": {"color": "violet", "size": "l", "w": 1288, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Liabilities"}]}]}}, "index": "a7WOj", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 660.6689895470383, "y": 1781, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-1v", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-t", "props": {"w": 399.3310104529616, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Receivables net of provision for doubtful debts. Investments at fai