s-making company: basic EPS = diluted EPS."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aHU8N", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 216, "y": 138.79999999999927, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-6", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-3", "props": {"color": "grey", "size": "m", "w": 1128, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Chapter 8 of 15"}]}]}}, "index": "a3UtY", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 216, "y": 60, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-v", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-t", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "xl", "w": 940, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1.2, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The balance sheet"}]}]}}, "index": "a2VGn", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 239.56794425087108, "y": 939, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-19", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-t", "props": {"w": 413.10104529616723, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "PPE still under construction"}]}]}}, "index": "aGpxQ", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1084, "y": 719, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-1z", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch08-t", "props": {"color": "light-blue", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The book's goodwill example", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "In FY 2018, Bharti Airtel bought 100% of Tigo Rwanda for "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Rs 3,200 crore", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". Tigo's net assets were worth "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Rs 2,838 crore", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". The extra "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Rs 362 crore", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " was recorded as goodwill. If a company pays "}, {"type": "text", "text": "less", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " than fair value, the difference goes to "}, {"type": "text", "text": "capital reserve", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " under equity."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 360, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.3, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aggRM", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 216, "y": 60, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-8a", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-88", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "xl", "w": 940, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1.2, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Other things to track"}]}]}}, "index": "a24Yv", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 712, "y": 1278.9599999999919, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-9b", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch08-8t", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "15.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Gross profit usually cannot be computed for Indian companies."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aIp4r", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 222, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-7", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-3", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1004, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Chapters 5 to 7 looked at the economy, the industry and the company's business. Financial analysis turns all that into the company's likely "}, {"type": "text", "text": "profits, cash flows", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " and, finally, the "}, {"type": "text", "text": "fair value", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " of its shares. Financial statements also supply the numbers for market sizing (6.4), industry KPIs (6.7) and strengths and weaknesses (7.5)."}]}]}}, "index": "a4PU3", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 216, "y": 138.8000000000029, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-w", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-t", "props": {"color": "grey", "size": "m", "w": 1128, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Chapter 8 of 15  ·  Part 1 of 2"}]}]}}, "index": "a3XeQ", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 2605, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-7a", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-5n", "props": {"w": 279.5604395604396, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Receivable turnover", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "axBY2", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 216, "y": 138.8000000000029, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-8b", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-88", "props": {"color": "grey", "size": "m", "w": 1128, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Chapter 8 of 15"}]}]}}, "index": "a3Oo2", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1040, "y": 1278.9599999999919, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-9c", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch08-8t", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "16.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " EBITDA is best for comparing firms; EBIT is \"operating profit\"."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aJQJM", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1084, "y": 222, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-8", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch08-3", "props": {"color": "light-blue", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "You do not need to be an accountant", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The book says an analyst need not be a great accountant, but must be able to read and interpret financial statements. Accounting knowledge helps."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 168, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.3, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "a5C9n", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 222, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-x", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-t", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Format: Schedule III of the Companies Act, 2013. "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Banks, insurers and utilities", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " follow formats set by their own regulators. The book uses Bharti Airtel's consolidated balance sheet for 31 March 2019 as its example."}]}]}}, "index": "a4M0I", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1453, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-6a", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-5n", "props": {"w": 279.5604395604396, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "PAT margin", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "aNvjb", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 343.5604395604396, "y": 2605, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-7b", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-5n", "props": {"w": 283.0549450549451, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Revenue ÷ Average receivables"}]}]}}, "index": "ayllQ", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 236, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-8c", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-88", "props": {"color": "violet", "size": "l", "w": 1288, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "History of equity expansion"}]}]}}, "index": "a4p8E", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1606.9599999999919, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-9d", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch08-8t", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "17.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Deferred tax has no cash impact."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aKVrv", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 0, "y": 1685.0000000000014, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-9", "type": "frame", "props": {"w": 1400, "h": 2302.4000000000015, "name": "8.1 The financial statements", "color": "black"}, "parentId": "page:page", "index": "a2CE2", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 312, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-y", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-t", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Assets", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " are items expected to give future benefits. A company can show only assets that can be measured in money and "}, {"type": "text", "text": "have been paid for", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". So a company generally cannot show its own "}, {"type": "text", "text": "self-generated brand", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}}, "index": "a54NA", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1084, "y": 522, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-5a", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch08-52", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "EXAM TRAP", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Management will usually say it does not expect to lose. Look at the "}, {"type": "text", "text": "size", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " of contingent liabilities compared with the P&L and balance sheet. If large, be cautious."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 144, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.3, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "a8SEz", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 343.5604395604396, "y": 1453, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-6b", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-5n", "props": {"w": 283.0549450549451, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "PAT ÷ Net sales"}]}]}}, "index": "aOsIv", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 634.6153846153848, "y": 2605, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-7c", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-5n", "props": {"w": 709.3846153846154, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Higher is better: faster collection"}]}]}}, "index": "azSmj", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 311, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-8d", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-88", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Raising money costs the business; if raised expensively, existing shareholders bear it. Debt costs are clear from the contract; the cost of issuing equity is harder to see. Ways to issue shares:"}]}]}}, "index": "a5owX", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 384, "y": 1606.9599999999919, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-9e", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch08-8t", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "18.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Buying assets: negative investing cash flow. Borrowing: positive financing cash flow."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aLXSz", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 402, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-z", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-t", "props": {"w": 1288, "h": 144, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Current asset", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": Gives benefit within one operating cycle, usually taken as one year. If the cycle is longer than a year, one year is the convention."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Non-current asset", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": Gives benefit over the long term, usually more than one year. Everything that is not current."}]}]}]}]}}, "index": "a6g0E", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1065, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-4a", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-43", "props": {"color": "grey", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Signs, as the book describes them"}]}]}}, "index": "a7fTb", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1009.1999999999971, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-5b", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-52", "props": {"color": "violet", "size": "l", "w": 1288, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Off-balance sheet items"}]}]}}, "index": "a9QLA", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 634.6153846153848, "y": 1453, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-6c", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-5n", "props": {"w": 709.3846153846154, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Share of sales left for shareholders. Bharti: 2.1%"}]}]}}, "index": "aP17j", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 2715, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-7d", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-5n", "props": {"w": 279.5604395604396, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Payable turnover", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "b00o2f", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 401, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-8e", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-88", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Rights issue (to existing shareholders in proportion to holdings)"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Public issue (IPO or FPO)"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Private placement: preferential issue, qualified institutional placement (QIP)"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Exercise of warrants"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "ESOPs or sweat equity"}]}]}]}]}}, "index": "a6F6A", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 712, "y": 1606.9599999999919, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-9f", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch08-8t", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "19.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Contingent liabilities are not recorded in the accounts, only in notes."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aMWsU", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1333, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-3a", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-2k", "props": {"w": 272.12598425196853, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Income from equity-accounted entities", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "aQGLz", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1123, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-4b", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-43", "props": {"w": 413.3333333333333, "h": 234, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "violet", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Operating", "marks": [{"type": "italic"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "From the business (P&L items)", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Net profit + non-cash expenses (depreciation, amortisation) ± changes in receivables and payables."}]}]}}, "index": "a8eVI", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1084.199999999997, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-5c", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch08-52", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Any asset or liability that does not appear on the balance sheet. The book's examples: "}, {"type": "text", "text": "operating leases", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", "}, {"type": "text", "text": "contingent liabilities", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", and "}, {"type": "text", "text": "derivative contracts", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (shown only in notes). Derivatives have threatened many businesses worldwide, so analyse these in detail, especially negative surprises."}]}]}}, "index": "aA1Cb", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1539, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-6d", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch08-5n", "props": {"w": 279.5604395604396, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "NOPAT", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "aQn22", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 343.5604395604396, "y": 2715, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch08-7e", "type": "geo", "parentId": "sh